<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cenbank 2-wk repo avg yield 14.49 percent.</title>
<headline>Czech cenbank 2-wk repo avg yield 14.49 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank two-week repo tender on Friday was 14.49 percent, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The maximum limit yield on bids was set at 14.50 percent, unchanged from the previous tender. The central bank does not disclose the volume on offer or completed transactions.</p>
